    "en": {
      "name": "Graceful & Skull Dice",
      "effect": "Roll a six-sided die twice and apply these effects for the rest of this turn.\n\u25cf Monsters you control that mention \"Dark Time Wizard\" gain ATK/DEF equal to the total x 200.\n\u25cf Monsters your opponent controls lose ATK/DEF equal to the total x 200.\nIf your opponent Normal or Special Summons a monster(s) while this card is in your GY (except during the Damage Step): You can banish this card, then target 1 of those monsters; roll a six-sided die twice, and if the total is 6 or more, destroy that monster.",
      "official": false
    },
    "ja": {
